---
title: TransactionTypeContractCreationError.__init__ (Osaka Exceptions)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> q_init : start
    q_init --> q_validate : transaction received
    q_validate --> q_format : msg = f"transaction type {type(transaction).__name__} not allowed to create contracts"
    q_format --> q_super : super().__init__(msg)
    q_super --> q_assign : self.transaction = transaction
    q_assign --> [*] : raise TransactionTypeContractCreationError

    note right of q_validate
        INV-003: transaction is of a type
        that disallows contract creation
    end note

    note right of q_assign
        INV-004: The transaction object is
        preserved in the exception for inspection
    end note
